es this over long tasks and conversation.", "url": "https://x.com/thatsbit3r/status/2117409096332611745"}, {"author_id": "892200813405233152", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:08:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117408648326775182"], "id": "2117408648326775182", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4398626122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117307611338997846", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@OpenAI I’m glad LifeVal maps help to everyday life", "url": "https://x.com/QuyCoc_TienSinh/status/2117408648326775182"}, {"author_id": "856946951945830401", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:08:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117408422136279148"], "id": "2117408422136279148", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1763874937218228224", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117314675675390221", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@lastxuanshenjin @yv_thorne @OpenAI 那种人机恋的吧，现实没有爱他们的人，能理解", "url": "https://x.com/Izumo_Yukari/status/2117408422136279148"}, {"author_id": "3502032614", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:05:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407696588841427"], "id": "2117407696588841427", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4398626122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117307611338997846", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@OpenAI 「何を答えられるか」ではなく「用事をどこまで終わらせられるか」で測る方向は、仕事でも同じだと思います。\n中小企業でも、物差しを自社の実際の作業に置き換えると、どこからAIに任せるかを決めやすくなります。", "url": "https://x.com/3chhe/status/2117407696588841427"}], "includes": {"media": [{"duration_ms": 60000, "height": 1080, "media_key": "13_2117307511820754944", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117307511820754944/img/KAscj7SLp6lhMJr9.jpg", "type": "